    "061b0d20-e98a-47d8-9f35-f44f31d51acc": {
      "type": "columns-2",
      "blocks": {
        "2916552a-4524-4aff-acbc-634e4afb6d00": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "The Resort",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Convenient yet secluded in stunning Guanacaste, Costa Rica, the Rythmia experiences includes all the comforts to fully integrate your journey from beautiful accommodations and grounds, to a salt water pool, volcanic mud bath, cold plunge and sauna. </p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/rythmia-resort-room-1200x800.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "aaa35b1a-8f7f-40b4-88b2-307c26dd6c43": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Medical Evaluations",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Rythmia Medical Clinic is staffed by a team of licensed medical professionals and play a critical role ensuring guest physical and emotional safety. Beyond our stringent intake process, our team offers holistic care and support as-needed throughout the week.  </p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Rythmia_1.67.1_1.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "643bace9-4996-4be4-b931-2de728a157a3": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Ayahuasca Ceremonies",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Led by experienced shamans from the Colombian lineage, this psychedelic journey will help you to navigate unresolved emotions and dispel limiting beliefs, fostering profound spiritual healing.</p><p>Individuals that are exploring the world of plant medicine for the first time can be reassured that they are being guided by adept facilitators deeply rooted in the Colombian lineage. By tapping into the time-tested wisdom of this botanical remedy, individuals can effectively address lingering emotions and confront constraining beliefs, ultimately embarking on a journey towards profound spiritual awakening.</p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Girl_Hugging_Shaman.png",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "3add13bf-0d42-4859-bb63-8001878aaaff": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Breathwork Classes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Learn conscious and controlled breathing techniques that promote relaxation, stress reduction, emotional healing and spiritual growth from experts in acclaimed, expert-led breathwork classes. </p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/breathwork-01.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "cab40b70-71f5-4157-900c-344ccf2d5e06": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Yoga Classes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Our gentle yoga program is designed to support the integration of your plant medicine experiences. Our seasoned teachers provide adaptations for all levels, making them suitable whether you are a beginner or expert yogi. </p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Rythmia_1.45.2.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "bd48c292-e8fb-405b-9fc2-3e92ec363226": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Organic Meals",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>With a menu specifically tailored to foster ultimate health and nourishment, our organic, farm-to-table meals nurture and support our guest’s healing journey. </p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/rythmia-organic-meals-1200x800.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "891e006f-618e-4b78-ba35-8dfacd4d4274": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Rythmia Way Program",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The time-tested Rythmia Way program is designed to accelerate the self-discovery and growth of our guests for a more awakened and purposeful life. Our carefully developed curriculum and distinguished thought leaders empower guests to fully embrace each modality of the program to create the deepest healing possible.</p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/rythmia-ayahuasca-1200x800.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "ebdfe271-9b08-404d-b048-054040ddfafd": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "“The Answer is You” Classes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>This course was designed by Michael Bernard Beckwith, best-selling author and founder of the Agape International Spiritual Center, specifically for Rythmia. The curriculum assists with integration during your stay and helping ground retreat attendees in a spiritual practice to help you process your experience.</p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/rythmia-michael-beckwith-1200x800.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        }
      },
