          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "center",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h3>Transformational Retreat with You in Mind</h3><p>This retreat has been curated with you in mind. With a focus on mind, body, and soul, we know you will walk away from this retreat feeling encouraged and refreshed. </p>"
