    "a20a922c-8177-4238-9a68-613b8989dee4": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20314778796353__a20a922c-8177-4238-9a68-613b8989dee4-testimonial-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“A friend had told me about her miracle and my husband and I decided to book, because we had been wanting to experience Ayahuasca in a safe setting. Rythmia was the best choice, because you are well prepared beforehand and guided throughout.”</p>",
            "author": "Hanna",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20314778796353__a20a922c-8177-4238-9a68-613b8989dee4-testimonial-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“First of all, Rythmia was truly a dream come true for me. I wanted to take part in a plant medicine ceremony . But I wanted it to be a controlled and safe environment . Well, well I happened upon Rythmia, and it was so much more than I ever expected. From the moment I reached out to them, till the day I returned home, the service was stellar. The staff on-site was so welcoming, professional, and gorgeous.”</p>",
            "author": "Jean",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20314778796353__a20a922c-8177-4238-9a68-613b8989dee4-testimonial-3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“For seekers being called to do the work, there cannot be a better place for your plant medicine journey. In addition to traditional ceremonies with authentic shamans of extensive lineage, Rythmia’s system of preparation and integration is key, with supplemental coursework, breathwork, yoga, spa, and whole-food organic meals…in a medically-staffed resort setting. Rythmia provides a comfortable and safe setting for you to go deep, and change your life.”</p>",
            "author": "Stephen",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "5b8fa352-89a8-41e1-ae13-c37694cc8c46": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“I just love it. I love what’s happening here. If you’re called for advancement in your own life, you want to think of Rythmia.”</p>",
            "author": "Michael",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
