    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Exclusions",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>All individuals are screened for medical purposes before booking to ensure they are eligible for the program. Medical reasons range from medications with contraindications to specific diagnoses and conditions. Rythmia's caring team will discuss these in your discovery call and all screening is conducted again on-site to uphold the highest level of safety for all our guests.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "ced5bdc3-cbd0-4d38-8816-9d58a157be58": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Pricing",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Prices vary based on dates, accommodations, and scheduled speakers; Gaia members save 10% on advertised rates.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Reservation and Payment",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Payment is due in full before arrival.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "88fe273d-dad8-4fcb-8e72-e298aeffea83": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Cancellation and Refunds",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Rythmia's general policy is no refunds are available.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Retreat Changes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>When a guest requires a schedule change, when feasible, Rythmia will do their best to accommodate. In the rare instance of a change in their planned program, they work with our guests to seamlessly accommodate rescheduling.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Insurance",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Rythmia does not provide insurance, however we highly recommend that you consider purchasing travel insurance to protect your investment and provide you with peace of mind. Travel insurance can offer coverage for unexpected situations such as trip cancellations, delays, medical emergencies, and more.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8fef7e85-3dbd-4573-b556-4afbf969813d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Waiver of Responsibility",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>On your discovery call, Rythmia's team will brief you on the required waiver and medical documentation.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "7095d1c2-5359-4f1f-a1e0-070d2644f848": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Disclaimer",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Gaia, its staff, affiliates, and content providers are not licensed medical care providers, and, as such, are not rendering medical advice or treatment, and have no expertise in advising on, diagnosing, examining, or treating medical conditions of any kind. You should never disregard medical advice or delay seeking it because of any statements/treatments made within any offering on the Gaia Marketplace. You must consult your doctor before beginning any product usage, medical or dietary treatment or exercise program. The views, opinions and results expressed in any products/programs offered here do not reflect the views or opinions of Gaia, its staff, content providers or any entities Gaia represents.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "92831aaa-ae05-420c-9600-67e471449e46": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Contact Rythmia",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Contact the Rythmia team directly at (833) 217-7032 anytime during their normal business hours (Monday - Friday 6 am - 6 pm PST, Saturday & Sunday 6am - 5pm PST).</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
